=== README.md
# Calc

Editor support for Calc. It starts `calc lsp`, which has to be on the path, or set
`calc.server.path`.

To try it: `npm install`, `npm run compile`, open this folder in Visual Studio Code
and press F5. To make a package: `npx @vscode/vsce package`.

